  <90>Pass a result straight to the next instruction.<0>

  <90> 1  # Each add needs the result just computed. Forwarding<0>
  <90> 2  # hands it over between stages, so nothing waits.<0>
   3  addi x5, x0, 5     # x5 = 5
   4  addi x6, x5, 3     # needs x5: forwarded, x6 = 8
   5  add  x7, x6, x5    # needs x6 and x5: x7 = 13

